hpc:Servicejob a owl:Class .
hpc:threadlimit a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Servicejob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:jobterminationdeadline a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Servicejob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .
hpc:swaplimit a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Servicejob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:nonNegativeInteger .
hpc:runtime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Servicejob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:duration .
hpc:Hostname rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Hostmodel rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:runTime rdfs:subPropertyOf hpc:runTime .
hpc:runtime/hostName a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:runtime/hostModel a owl:ObjectProperty .
hpc:help a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Servicejob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:version a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain hpc:Servicejob ;
    rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:Keyboardoperations a owl:Class .
hpc:Screenreaderoperations a owl:Class .
hpc:Cli a owl:Class .


This ontology fragment defines classes for ServiceJob, its properties, and accessibility features like KeyboardOperations, ScreenReaderOperations, and CLI. It also includes properties for command-line options such as thread limit, job termination deadline, swap limit, run time, and accessibility features like help and version. The properties have appropriate domains and ranges defined.
